    "A focused platform for a growing trade relationship": "一个专注于不断发展的贸易关系的平台",
    "Kenya and China bring different strengths to the tea industry. Kenya has deep experience in growing, processing and exporting tea. China is a major tea market and a centre for tea production, technology, product development and tea culture.": "Kenya和China在茶叶行业拥有不同的优势。Kenya在茶叶种植、加工和出口方面拥有深厚的经验。China是一个主要的茶叶市场,也是茶叶生产、技术、产品开发和茶文化的中心。",
    "The summit creates a practical meeting point for the people shaping this relationship. The focus is direct: build stronger commercial links, support value addition, improve market access and identify investment and technology partnerships that can move from conversation to action.": "峰会为塑造这一关系的人士创造了一个务实的交流平台。重点非常明确:建立更强大的商业联系,支持价值增值,改善市场准入,并确定能够从对话转化为行动的投资和技术合作伙伴关系。",
    "<a href=\"/about/\">About the summit</a>": "<a href=\"/about/\">关于峰会</a>",
    "<span class=\"plate__no\">Plate I</span>Kenya&#39;s growing highlands": "<span class=\"plate__no\">图版 I</span>Kenya的高地种植区",
    "What the summit is designed to achieve": "峰会旨在实现的目标",
    "<div>\n          <h3>Grow direct trade</h3>\n          <p>Connect Kenyan producers and exporters with Chinese importers, distributors, brands and buyers.</p>\n        </div>": "<div>\n          <h3>促进直接贸易</h3>\n          <p>连接Kenya的生产商和出口商与China的进口商、分销商、品牌和买家。</p>\n        </div>",
    "<div>\n          <h3>Support value addition</h3>\n          <p>Explore opportunities in specialty tea, green tea, orthodox tea, packaging, branding and product development.</p>\n        </div>": "<div>\n          <h3>支持价值增值</h3>\n          <p>探索特种茶、绿茶、传统工艺茶、包装、品牌和产品开发方面的机会。</p>\n        </div>",
    "<div>\n          <h3>Bring investment closer to the industry</h3>\n          <p>Create space for investors, banks and development finance institutions to engage with commercially viable opportunities across the tea value chain.</p>\n        </div>": "<div>\n          <h3>让投资更贴近行业</h3>\n          <p>为投资者、银行和开发性金融机构创造空间,使其能够参与茶叶价值链上具有商业可行性的机会。</p>\n        </div>",
    "<div>\n          <h3>Put technology in front of the people who use it</h3>\n          <p>Introduce processing equipment, agricultural technology, traceability systems and logistics solutions to producers and processors.</p>\n        </div>": "<div>\n          <h3>将技术呈现给使用者</h3>\n          <p>向生产商和加工商介绍加工设备、农业技术、可追溯系统和物流解决方案。</p>\n        </div>",
    "<div>\n          <h3>Make market access easier to understand</h3>\n          <p>Bring buyers, exporters, regulators and standards specialists into the same conversation.</p>\n        </div>": "<div>\n          <h3>使市场准入更易于理解</h3>\n          <p>将买家、出口商、监管机构和标准专家纳入同一对话。</p>\n        </div>",
    "<div>\n          <h3>Celebrate tea as business and culture</h3>\n          <p>Create room for Kenyan and Chinese tea traditions, consumer preferences and product stories to be shared with a wider international audience.</p>\n        </div>": "<div>\n          <h3>将茶叶作为商业和文化加以赞颂</h3>\n          <p>为Kenya和China的茶叶传统、消费者偏好和产品故事创造空间,与更广泛的国际受众分享。</p>\n        </div>",
    "<h2>Three days in Nairobi</h2>": "<h2>在内罗毕的三天</h2>",
    "Opening ceremony and Trade Forum": "开幕式与贸易论坛",
    "A practical look at the Kenya-China tea market: demand, product fit, standards, routes to market and the relationships needed to grow trade.": "肯尼亚-中国茶叶市场实务考察:需求、产品适配性、标准、市场渠道以及促进贸易增长所需的关系网络。",
    "Investment Forum, Innovation Conference and B2B Matchmaking": "投资论坛、创新大会与B2B配对洽谈",
